{"suttaId":"ja180","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ja-i","vriCode":"s0513m.mul","paras":[1107,1117],"vripara":"59"},"segments":{"ja180:0.4":"Duddadajātakaṃ (2-3-10)","ja180:1.1":"Duddadaṃ dadamānānaṃ, dukkaraṃ kamma kubbataṃ;","ja180:1.3":"Asanto nānukubbanti, sataṃ dhammo durannayo.","ja180:2.1":"Tasmā satañca asataṃ, nānā hoti ito gati;","ja180:2.3":"Asanto nirayaṃ yanti, santo saggaparāyaṇāti [parāyanā (syā. ka.)].","ja180:3.1":"Duddadajātakaṃ dasamaṃ.","ja180:3.2":"Kalyāṇavaggo tatiyo.","ja180:4.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","ja180:5.1":"Susamaññamigādhibhū māṇavako, vāripahūtarūpādiccupaṭṭhānā;","ja180:5.3":"Sakaḷāyasatindukapaṅka puna, satadhamma sududdadakena dasāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
